[{"html":"\u003cdiv class=\"card\" data-review=\"/lax/yangs-kitchen/\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"thumb\"\u003e\n            \u003cimg src=\"https://pics.gourmandsyndrome.com/yangs-kitchen%2F0_front-640x480.webp\" alt=\"Yang\u0026#39;s Kitchen\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"body\"\u003e\n        \u003ca class=\"title\" href=\"https://www.gourmandsyndrome.com/lax/yangs-kitchen/\"\u003eYang\u0026#39;s Kitchen\u003c/a\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"loc\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.gourmandsyndrome.com/lax/neighborhood/alhambra/\"\u003e\n\n\nAlhambra\u003c/a\u003e · \u003ca href=\"/lax/\"\u003eLos Angeles\u003c/a\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"cuisine-chips\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.gourmandsyndrome.com/lax/cuisine/new-american/\"\u003eNew American\u003c/a\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.gourmandsyndrome.com/lax/cuisine/taiwanese/\"\u003eTaiwanese\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"excerpt\"\u003eWe’ve finally arrived in Los Angeles to kick it with family before heading up to Mammoth for a wedding. This restaurant was suggested because it has modern Taiwanese American tastes to it that is seemingly becoming a trend in the Alhambra areas. Unlike NYC, I’ve always felt LA had better Asian food in the low/mid price ranges, so let’s see how it tastes. We were able to wait list on Yelp for about 5 minutes around 10:15 AM.\u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"foot\"\u003e\n            \u003cspan class=\"date\"\u003eApr 16, 2023\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003cspan class=\"icon-links\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/yang-s-kitchen-alhambra\" title=\"Yelp\" aria-label=\"Yang\u0026#39;s Kitchen on Yelp\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"fab fa-yelp\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/kLgEod4fXoMcwXjX6?coh=178572\u0026amp;entry=tt\" title=\"Google Maps\" aria-label=\"Yang\u0026#39;s Kitchen on Google Maps\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"fas fa-map-marker-alt\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.yangskitchenla.com/\" title=\"Website\" aria-label=\"Yang\u0026#39;s Kitchen website\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"fas fa-arrow-up-right-from-square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n","id":"/lax/yangs-kitchen/"},{"html":"\u003cdiv class=\"card\" data-review=\"/lax/xecora/\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"thumb no-photo\"\u003e\n            \u003cdiv class=\"no-photo-mark\"\u003e\u003csvg viewBox=\"0 0 900 900\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"\u003e\n\u003ccircle cx=\"450\" cy=\"450\" r=\"414\" fill=\"#7a2b28\"\u003e\u003c/circle\u003e\n\u003ccircle cx=\"450\" cy=\"450\" r=\"258\" fill=\"#1c1b1a\"\u003e\u003c/circle\u003e\n\u003cpath fill=\"#f7f2ea\" d=\"M 451.5 324 L 486.5 324 L 487.5 325 L 501.5 326 L 527.5 335 L 542 346.5 L 546 352.5 L 549 367.5 L 546 379.5 L 532.5 395 Q 517.7 386.3 499.5 381 L 488.5 379 L 462.5 379 L 446.5 383 Q 432.4 388.4 423 398.5 L 411 416.5 L 407 428.5 L 405 448.5 L 406 449.5 L 407 468.5 L 410 478.5 Q 415.1 491.9 424.5 501 Q 440.9 517.6 474.5 517 L 485.5 515 L 494 512 L 494 476 L 453.5 476 Q 448.5 470 447 460.5 L 446 444.5 L 450 432.5 L 456.5 426 L 464.5 423 L 539.5 423 Q 549.9 425.1 555 432.5 L 559 445.5 L 559 529.5 L 557 539.5 Q 554.4 546.9 548.5 551 Q 513.2 574.2 451.5 571 L 418.5 565 L 401.5 559 Q 377.6 548.9 362 530.5 Q 346.9 513.6 340 488.5 L 336 466.5 L 336 431.5 L 337 430.5 L 339 413.5 L 345 395.5 Q 355.6 372.1 373.5 356 L 396.5 340 L 412.5 333 L 432.5 327 L 450.5 325 L 451.5 324 Z \"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\n\u003c/svg\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cspan class=\"no-photo-label\"\u003eNo photo yet\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"body\"\u003e\n        \u003ca class=\"title\" href=\"https://www.gourmandsyndrome.com/lax/xecora/\"\u003eXécora\u003c/a\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"loc\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www